  focus="plumbing"
  title="Plumber in Franklin, IN | Leak Detection Bargersville"
  description="Plumber for Franklin, Indiana homes: water heaters, drains, sewer lines, burst and frozen pipes, and hidden leaks pinpointed before anything is opened."
  h1="Plumber in Franklin, Indiana"
  answer={`Plumbing repair for Franklin homes — from the older houses near downtown to newer neighborhoods on the edge of town. We’re based nearby in ${site.city}, and we locate hidden leaks before opening anything, so repairs stay small.`}
  sections={[
    {
      h2: 'Plumbing services in Franklin',
      list: [
        '[Water heater repair and replacement](/plumbing/water-heater-repair/)',
        '[Drain cleaning](/plumbing/drain-cleaning/) for slow and clogged drains',
        '[Sewer line repair](/plumbing/sewer-line-repair/) after a camera inspection',
        '[Burst, frozen and leaking pipe repair](/plumbing/pipe-repair/)',
        '[Help with plumbing emergencies](/plumbing/emergency-plumber/)',
        '[Leak detection](/) for slabs, walls, buried lines, pools and sprinklers',
