    { title: 'Water heater failures', text: 'Leaking tanks, no hot water and sediment noise are common as heaters age.' },
    { title: 'Hidden leaks and high bills', text: 'A meter that moves with everything off points to a hidden leak in a wall, slab or buried line.' },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    { q: 'Do you work in Franklin, IN?', a: `Yes. We’re based in ${site.city} and serve homes throughout Franklin and the rest of Johnson County.` },
    { q: 'My older Franklin home keeps having drain backups. What’s causing it?', a: 'Repeat backups usually mean roots, a crack or a sag in the sewer line. A camera inspection shows exactly what and where.' },
    { q: 'How do I reach you?', a: `Call ${site.phone} and describe the problem.` },
